# Context
Entries from the Azure Activity log that provides insight into any subscription-level or management group level events that have occurred in Azure. Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-monitor/reference/tables/azureactivity

# Suggested Queries
## Check for ...
```kql
AzureActivity
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
...
```

